    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The timeline is pretty set; we start the data migration on Monday and your instance will be offline by Friday. The new engine is much simpler—it just follows a strict 'if-then' logic based on established wear-and-tear thresholds. It's way more predictable for the auditors, even if it's not as 'smart' as what you're doing now.",
